4. DO NOT STOP UNTIL YOU RUN THIS EXACT VERIFICATION SEQUENCE AND ALL PASS:
   down; claude mcp list; c; claude mcp list; mcps; mcpl

   Helper functions available:
   - down: cd F:\downloads
